@startuml
title Smart Agriculture Gateway - State Machine

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> CONNECTED : Sensor connects
CONNECTED --> RECEIVING : Telemetry received

RECEIVING --> VALIDATING : Message parsed

VALIDATING --> PROCESSING : Valid telemetry
VALIDATING --> ERROR : Invalid telemetry

PROCESSING --> ALERT_CHECK : Processing complete

ALERT_CHECK --> LOGGING : Alerts checked
LOGGING --> RECEIVING : Continue monitoring

ERROR --> LOGGING : Log validation error
LOGGING --> RECEIVING : Wait for next telemetry

RECEIVING --> DISCONNECTED : Connection closed
DISCONNECTED --> IDLE : Ready for next node

@enduml
